e las que contenido tiene el juego me congratula decir que es una buena idea pero realizada por un mal equipo", "timestamp_created": 1726530014, "timestamp_updated": 1726530014, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 15, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "174829766", "author": {"steamid": "76561198802828771", "personaname": "Tulula", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198802828771/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1277, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1207, "last_played": 1752034712, "avatar": "d71a950f1d33304555b05f3b067e7cb3159ac7f7"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "si ta al mismo precio que el l4d y no te da paja armarte un mazo de cartas, ta weno", "timestamp_created": 1726184816, "timestamp_updated": 1726184816, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "174568991", "author": {"steamid": "76561198119661337", "personaname": "RisterX", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RX022/", "num_games_owned": 551, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 718, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 718, "last_played": 1725832993, "avatar": "bcd42488f646d3c0be66bd3e584bcacfd5088a0d"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Completé los 4 actos en 11hs chill con un amigo y la verdad no lo recomiendo, es bastante repetitivo, incluso utilizando cartas de habilidades. No podés armar clases de armas para llevar desde el refugio, solo mejorar las que te da el juego (cuando en el campo de tiro hay decenas de armas para utilizar, en las misiones solo encontrás 1 bate, 1 machete, 1 m4, 1 escopeta y 1 ak-47) y de ahí...solo podés mejorarlas con monedas en el checkpoint de cada refugio.\r\nSi querés el juego completo...son 45USD más (acto 5 y 6) y 65USD con skins y cartas.\r\nSino...el juego termina en el acto 4 con una cinemática de un monstruo, para ser campaña...bastante pobre, no conocés la historia de ningún personaje (podrían haberlo hecho)", "timestamp_created": 1725845723, "timestamp_updated": 1725845723, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519999980926513672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "174545384", "author": {"steamid": "76561198879323963", "personaname": "vasyli123", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198879323963/", "num_games_owned": 375, "num_reviews": 82, "playtime_forever": 2409, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2409, "last_played": 1722111748, "avatar": "871161f1074295e43972acacdaa765c5a6c73a85"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "El juego en si esta bien pasarselo en normal, tiene mecanicas similares a otros tipos de juegos solo que agregan un detalle de ¨clases¨ con cartas que se hace pesadisimo si no sabes que usar o que necesitas. Recomendado para jugar con amigos pero solo el modo normal.", "timestamp_created": 1725817699, "timestamp_updated": 1725817699, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_